   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "My profession",
   "texto": [
    "In these examples, **работать** expresses the profession with instrumental, without preposition: **Я работаю врачом** (work as a doctor), **Он работает учителем** (work as a teacher). In the present you can also identify someone with the nominee: **Я врач** (I am a doctor).",
    "To ask, **Кем ты работаешь?** is said, with **кем**, the **кто** instrument."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "What you want to be",
   "texto": [
    "To say what you want to become, **стать** goes with instruments: **Я хочу стать врачом** (I want to be a doctor). **хотеть быть** also uses the instrument: **Кем ты хочешь быть?** (what do you want to be?).",
    "In the examples of this lesson, **врач** forms **врачом** (with **-ом**) and **учитель**, which ends in **-ь**, form **учителем** (with **-ем**)."
